DICTIONARY DATA
---------------
JMdict_e.gz
  This add-on uses the JMdict dictionary file. This file is the property of
  the Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG), and is
  used in conformance with the Group's licence:
  https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  Project page: https://www.edrdg.org/jmdict/j_jmdict.html

JmdictFurigana.json.gz
  JmdictFurigana by Doublevil — https://github.com/Doublevil/JmdictFurigana
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA),
  like JMdict itself.

The files above are distributed unmodified (only gzip-compressed). The
dictionary cache built in user_files/ is derived from them and falls under
the same CC BY-SA licence.
